[ai5PriestDead][ai4PriestDead]
<h2>You receive a message from the {sw_god3}.</h2><br>
<i>You will surely perish for killing one of my warriors.</i>
$OnExit= ,Tell,showmenu
$Button=Let's kill another,DoNothing,0

[ai7PriestDead]
<h2>Good job Ace! The Guardian of Thunder City is dead!</h2>
<i>You have opened up the main line of attack.<br>
You will receive a reward for this.<i>
$OnExit= ,Tell,showmenu
<$ChangeMoney,2000>
$Button=OK,DoNothing,0


[ai6PriestCaptured]
<h2>You receive a message from the {sw_god5}</h2><br>
<i>Sacrifice him now so we can gain the knowledge of the Thunder Fury.<br>
I will give you some additional storm power for your bravery.</i>
<$ChangeMoney,2000>
$Button=OK,tell,askalliance

[askalliance]
<h2>You receive a message from Theorian!</h2>
<i>Priest, I want us to have an alliance together!</i>
<p>
Will you accept his alliance and betray Hades or will you gain the last bit
 of knowledge that you need to learn?
$Button=I'll be your ally,Tell,AllianceBegun
$Button=Are you crazy?,Tell NoDeal
$Timeout=25,Tell,AllianceWithdrawn


[AllianceBegun]
<$Config,sw_pickally1=1>
<$Config,sw_m15=0>
<$Config,sw_m16=1>
<$Config,sw_difficulty1=0>
<$Config,sw_mvar0=4000>
<$Config,sw_mvar1=6000>
<$Config,sw_mvar2=5>
<$Config,sw_mvar3=5000>
<$Config,sw_mvar4=2>
<$MissionBegin,sw_m16>

[AllianceWithdrawn]
<$Config,sw_pickally1=0>
<p>You took too long to respond.  The {sw_god5}, seeing that you were deciding
to betray him, is going to kill you now.
<$Config,sw_m15=0>
<$Config,sw_m24=1>
$Button=OH NO! Hades Altar,MissionBegin,sw_m24

[NoDeal]
<$Config,sw_pickally1=0>


[ai6PriestDead]
The ambassador of Thunder City is dead.
$OnExit= ,Tell,showmenu
$Button=OK,DoNothing,0

   
[ai2PriestDead][ai3PriestDead]
You are in serious peril for one of your allies just bit the dust.
$Button=OK,DoNothing,0




