[Succeeded][BadTeamDead]
<h2> You've done it!</h2>
The {sw_god5} laughs with glee!
<p>
<i>"Now, groveler, your true test of worth is at hand. I have coddled you like a
child and have shown you the way of Power. You have proven.... er... tolerable.
Indeed, you have surprised even myself that you have lasted this long, for the
training has been slightly..... difficult for a mere mortal like yourself.
<p>
I will not tolerate failure now! I am too close to what I seek most of all... revenge!</i>
<p>
  
<$Config,sw_m15=0>
<$Config,sw_m17=1>
$Button=Onto the CHOICE of the Furies!,MissionBegin,sw_m17



[Failed]
Your mind screams out in agony as you feel your body being pummeled around like a
rag doll! The last thing you remeber is intolerable pain as it feels like your
body is being torn to shreds....
<p>
After what seems like an eternity, you lose consciousness....
<p>
When you awake, you see an aparition of the {sw_god5} before you.
<p>
<i>"You disappoint me, Groveler, for I do not believe your heart is into it. So,
I gave you a little taste of what it will feel like if you fail me again."
<p>
"Remember, groveler, the pain and torture will last for eternity if you fail me again!"
<p>
You stagger to your feet, gasping for breath. The aparition disappears, leaving
you shaking uncontrollably. You dare not fail him again!
<$Config,sw_difficulty1=1>
$Button=Try again,MissionBegin,sw_m15

[END]
